{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend. Upgrade. Rise higher.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Spire: Tower Defense Demo is a fantasy roguelite where every battle brings you closer to greatness. Waves of relentless enemies test your tower\u2019s strength as you spend gold on powerful temporary boosts and collect gems to unlock lasting upgrades. When your tower falls, the run ends but your journey doesn\u2019t. Each defeat makes you stronger, letting you climb higher with every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo represents an early portion of the game. You can play through the first 10 waves and experience all currently available features, upgrades, and content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive fast, intense battles and power up with temporary upgrades each run.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086690/extras/569cf2998e3c0bab6b40a91af6222294.poster.avif?t=1760357967\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086690/extras/569cf2998e3c0bab6b40a91af6222294.webm?t=1760357967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086690/extras/569cf2998e3c0bab6b40a91af6222294.mp4?t=1760357967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn defeat into progress. Earn rewards after each run to climb higher next time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086690/extras/c0cf5132e571d0c29145ceb999f6543e.poster.avif?t=1760357967\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086690/extras/c0cf5132e571d0c29145ceb999f6543e.webm?t=1760357967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086690/extras/c0cf5132e571d0c29145ceb999f6543e.mp4?t=1760357967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest in permanent upgrades to make your tower stronger with every attempt.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086690/extras/fcd5dea1c7d74338f61ce92c1aa4df28.poster.avif?t=1760357967\" width=346 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086690/extras/fcd5dea1c7d74338f61ce92c1aa4df28.webm?t=1760357967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086690?t=1760357967","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086690?t=1760357967","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086690/0d89aee7f2dbcec410ce6b3e30817a55322a2d7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760357967","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086690/0d89aee7f2dbcec410ce6b3e30817a55322a2d7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760357967","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend. Upgrade. Rise higher.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragra